    <us-gaap:EarningsPerShareTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-630">&lt;div style="margin-top:15pt"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:10.238%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:87.562%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#0068b5;border-bottom:1pt solid #0068b5;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:14pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Note 4 : &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #0068b5;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0068b5;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:14pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Earnings (Loss) Per Share and Stockholders' Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;We computed basic earnings (loss) per share of common stock based on the weighted average number of shares of common stock that, during the period, are outstanding or are considered not contingently issuable based on the terms of the Warrant and Common Stock Agreement (U.S. Government Agreement). We computed diluted earnings (loss) per share of common stock based on the weighted average number of shares of common stock outstanding plus potentially dilutive shares of common stock outstanding during the period, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:52.451%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.483%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:9.828%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.483%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:9.828%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.483%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:9.828%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.483%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:9.833%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="9" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Three Months Ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="9" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Six Months Ended