n&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:6.11pt"&gt;Derivative assets are recorded as other assets, current and long-term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:6.11pt"&gt;Derivative liabilities are recorded as other liabilities, current and long-term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:6.11pt"&gt;Relates to our deferred compensation program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Gross derivative assets and liabilities subject to master netting agreements were $588 million and $628 million, respectively, as of June&#160;27, 2026 and $937 million and $654 million, respectively, as of December&#160;27, 2025. Gross amounts recognized for reverse repurchase agreements are fully offset by cash collateral pledged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:6pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0068b5;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Derivatives in Cash Flow Hedging Relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bo